# FIX2 (critic, lag rule): a reach part asks for the hop only where SOME line's reach place lies in the player's world (reachL rejects every
# other world anyway) - so the 5 archipelago visits cost nothing in the hub / a shard / anywhere off the islands. Cached per world for RW_MS
# (places move when island:places / places.properties change - 3 s late at most); a superset of the player's own open reach parts.
